1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,340
Last year around this time, as Nazreth
welcomed the evening...

2
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:12,360
My brother Ermias Mekonen and I were
racing against the clock.

3
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:22,030
Catching the last bajaj through the city
lights, the rush turned into pure joy.

4
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:28,880
A sudden evening rain changed our path,
leading us into an unexpected, lively

5
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:29,510
shelter.

6
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:35,950
Amidst games and laughter, he won a wager
that meant treating the whole family.

7
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:45,100
Over steaming coffee, he shared unexpected
good news, and joy swept over us.

8
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:54,740
In that quiet pause, without a word, we
felt the pride and bond we share.

9
00:00:55,400 --> 00:01:00,430
Carrying the memories and strength Nazreth
gave us, we headed home to family.
